# OS
.DS_Store

# VCS
.git
.gitignore

# tests & top-level docs/ not needed at deploy time
# Leading slash anchors `/docs/` to the repo root so it only matches
# the top-level markdown docs directory, NOT the Next route directory
# at apps/web/app/docs/. The unanchored `docs` pattern (gitignore
# semantics) matched any directory named `docs` at any depth and
# silently dropped /docs from the build manifest.
**/__tests__
**/*.test.*
/docs/
